You are working on Sentinel, a synthetic testing and uptime monitor (1 GB RAM / 0.5 vCPU target, one Node.js process, PostgreSQL, Next.js).

Read CONTRIBUTING.md first. It holds the binding rules, how work is briefed, the checks to run, the MCP text rule and the implementation log format. It points to docs/dev/ARCHITECTURE.md, docs/dev/DOMAINS.md, docs/dev/DESIGN.md and docs/guide/writing-tests.md.
